     'Subsea Cable Repair: Splicing Precision', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Rejoining a severed subsea line aboard a repair vessel is a delicate technical procedure. Technicians must strip away protective layers to expose individual silica [[b1]] no thicker than human hairs. In a dust-free laboratory environment, precision equipment aligns the cores before an electric arc performs microscopic [[b2]], producing a permanent, low-loss optical [[b3]].', '[{"id": "A", "text": "fibers"}, {"id": "B", "text": "fusion"}, {"id": "C", "text": "joint"}, {"id": "D", "text": "filaments"}, {"id": "E", "text": "splicing"}, {"id": "F", "text": "casing"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["fibers", "fusion", "joint", "filaments", "splicing", "casing"], "correctAnswer": "fibers"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["fibers", "fusion", "joint", "filaments", "splicing", "casing"], "correctAnswer": "fusion"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["fibers", "fusion", "joint", "filaments", "splicing", "casing"], "correctAnswer": "joint"}]'::jsonb,
