     'Portus Architecture: Inner Quays', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Trajan''s monumental expansion of Portus featured a colossal hexagonal basin designed for commercial logistics. Lined with brick warehouses and hydraulic [[b1]], the inner port provided secure berthing space sheltered from Mediterranean [[b2]]. Goods unloaded from maritime merchant vessels were subsequently transferred onto river barges for [[b3]] up the Tiber River to Rome.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "quays"}, {"id": "B", "text": "storms"}, {"id": "C", "text": "transport"}, {"id": "D", "text": "piers"}, {"id": "E", "text": "swells"}, {"id": "F", "text": "logistics"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["quays", "storms", "transport", "piers", "swells", "logistics"], "correctAnswer": "quays"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["quays", "storms", "transport", "piers", "swells", "logistics"], "correctAnswer": "storms"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["quays", "storms", "transport", "piers", "swells", "logistics"], "correctAnswer": "transport"}]'::jsonb,
