    ('q-pr89-rfib-04-03', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks',
     'Environmental Impact: Catchment Erosion', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Human modification of terrestrial landscapes profoundly influenced ancient coastal ports. Extensive clearing of catchment forests for agriculture increased soil [[b1]] by an order of magnitude. When torrential rains swept loose topsoil into river tributaries, immense quantities of [[b2]] flowed downstream, rapidly filling harbour basins and rendering them [[b3]] for deep-draft ships.', '[{"id": "A", "text": "erosion"}, {"id": "B", "text": "silt"}, {"id": "C", "text": "unusable"}, {"id": "D", "text": "weathering"}, {"id": "E", "text": "gravel"}, {"id": "F", "text": "inaccessible"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["erosion", "silt", "unusable", "weathering", "gravel", "inaccessible"], "correctAnswer": "erosion"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["erosion", "silt", "unusable", "weathering", "gravel", "inaccessible"], "correctAnswer": "silt"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["erosion", "silt", "unusable", "weathering", "gravel", "inaccessible"], "correctAnswer": "unusable"}]'::jsonb,
