     'Geoarchaeological Analysis: Core Sampling', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.',
     'Modern investigators reconstruct the history of silting harbours using sedimentary drill cores. By analyzing changes in particle grain size and fossilized [[b1]], scientists identify when human engineering maintained open-water [[b2]]. Layers containing contaminated lead residues reflect active industrial and shipping operations prior to ultimate port [[b3]].', '[{"id": "A", "text": "microorganisms"}, {"id": "B", "text": "conditions"}, {"id": "C", "text": "abandonment"}, {"id": "D", "text": "invertebrates"}, {"id": "E", "text": "environments"}, {"id": "F", "text": "depopulation"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["microorganisms", "conditions", "abandonment", "invertebrates", "environments", "depopulation"], "correctAnswer": "microorganisms"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["microorganisms", "conditions", "abandonment", "invertebrates", "environments", "depopulation"], "correctAnswer": "conditions"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["microorganisms", "conditions", "abandonment", "invertebrates", "environments", "depopulation"], "correctAnswer": "abandonment"}]'::jsonb,
