     'Paragraph D states that Burmese amber is of paramount scientific significance because it originated during the peak of the Mesozoic Era, preserving a diverse micro-ecological census from the Age of Dinosaurs.', 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE Reading', 'Original practice', 'Batch D'],
