     'Rare Inclusions: Delicate Organisms', 'According to paragraph C, which TWO ephemeral biological structures have been found preserved in amber?',
     NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Intact skeletal frames of adult woolly mammoths"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Submarine volcanic conduits carved into deep bedrock"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Large wooden war chariots with multi-spoke wheels"}, {"id": "D", "text": "Delicate spider webs featuring microscopic glue droplets"}, {"id": "E", "text": "Fungal fruiting bodies in the process of discharging spores"}]'::jsonb, '["D", "E"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
