    ('q-pr89-ro-001', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs',
     'Papyrus Manufacture in the Nile Delta', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.',
     NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "Workers then pounded the wet sheets with heavy wooden mallets, forcing the cellular sap to weld the fibers together."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "In ancient Egypt, the marshlands of the Nile Delta provided abundant thickets of Cyperus papyrus reeds."}, {"id": "p5", "text": "After thorough sun drying and smoothing with polished stones, the resulting scrolls formed durable writing surfaces that endured for millennia."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "Craftsmen harvested these aquatic stems and stripped away the fibrous green outer rinds to expose the white pith."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "This spongy pith was sliced into thin longitudinal strips, which were arranged in two overlapping perpendicular layers on wooden boards."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "p5"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
